## Why This Is Asked
This question tests knowledge of hybrid cloud data platform design, including cross-tenant governance, data residency compliance, and cost controls using Azure Arc, Purview, Lighthouse, and Private Link.

## Key Concepts
- Azure Arc-enabled data services for edge and on-premises analytics
- Hybrid data residency and governance
- Azure Lighthouse for cross-tenant management
- Microsoft Purview for data cataloging and lineage tracking
- Private Endpoints and Private Link for secure data access
- Terraform infrastructure as code with GitHub Actions CI/CD
- Disaster recovery planning and cost management controls

